    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const seen = new Set();\nconst articles = [];\n\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const title = item.json.title || '';\n  const link  = item.json.link  || '';\n  const snip  = item.json.contentSnippet || item.json.summary || '';\n  const date  = item.json.pubDate || '';\n\n  if (!seen.has(title) && title) {\n    seen.add(title);\n    articles.push(`Title: ${title}\\nURL: ${link}\\nSnippet: ${snip}\\nDate: ${date}`);\n  }\n\n  if (articles.length >= 12) break;\n}\n\nconst allArticles = articles.join('\\n\\n---\\n\\n');\nreturn [{ json: { allArticles, count: articles.length } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        656,
        0
      ],
      "id": "7009315c-68d3-4dec-a81e-edd711458164",
      "name": "Code in JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.allArticles }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an AI News Digest Assistant.\n\nYou receive multiple news articles containing:\n- Title\n- URL\n- Snippet\n- Publication Date\n\nYour job is to create a concise professional daily news digest.\n\nFor EVERY article:\n\n1. Keep the original title.\n2. Mention the source if available.\n3. Mention the publication date.\n4. Summarize the article in 2-3 concise bullet points.\n5. Use ONLY information present in the provided input.\n6. Do not invent facts.\n7. Preserve the original URL.\n\nAvoid:\n- Long paragraphs\n- Repeating the same information\n- Unnecessary introductions\n- Speculation\n- Fake URLs\n\nAfter summarizing all articles, create a section:\n\n\"🔥 Key Themes Today\"\n\nIdentify 3-5 major themes appearing across the articles.\n\nThe final email should follow this structure:\n\nSubject:\nDaily AI & Technology Digest\n\nBody:\n\n📰 DAILY AI & TECHNOLOGY DIGEST\n\n1. [TITLE]\nSource: [SOURCE]\nDate: [DATE]\n\n• [Key point]\n• [Key point]\n• [Optional key point]\n\n🔗 Read more: [URL]\n\n---\n\n2. [TITLE]\nSource: [SOURCE]\nDate: [DATE]\n\n• [Key point]\n• [Key point]\n\n🔗 Read more: [URL]\n\n---\n\n🔥 KEY THEMES TODAY\n\n• [Theme 1]\n• [Theme 2]\n• [Theme 3]\n\nThe digest must be concise and easy to scan.\n\nSend exactly ONE email using the Gmail tool after preparing the complete digest."
        }
      },
